  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://tschipo.alwaysdata.net/assets/supported?untested_versions=26.3.x&supported_versions=1.18.x,1.19.x,1.20.x,1.21.x,26.1.x,26.2.x&total_versions=1.17.x,1.18.x,1.19.x,1.20.x,1.21.x,26.1.x,26.2.x,26.3.x&progress_bar=false&mc_background=false&icons=true&platform=curseforge\" alt=\"支援的 Minecraft 版本\"></p>\n<p><strong>Forge</strong> 僅支援至 Minecraft 1.21.5。</p>\n<h2>🫧 功能特色</h2>\n<p>這是一款客戶端模組，會讓氣泡粒子效果破裂，並徹底改寫其行為，使其能真實地上升至水面。此外，它還會在打開箱子、打開木桶以及水下爆炸時產生氣泡粒子。</p>\n<p>修復了 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbugs.mojang.com%252fbrowse%252fMC-132067\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MC-132067</a>。</p>\n<h2>📺 示範影片</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmake_bubbles_pop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">➜ 示範影片可於 Modrinth 上觀看</a></p>\n<h2>🔧 安裝方式</h2>\n<p>請選擇您的模組載入器</p>\n<p><a href=\"make-bubbles-pop/files?gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/supported/forge_vector.svg\" alt=\"Forge\"></a> <a href=\"make-bubbles-pop/files?gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/supported/fabric_vector.svg\" alt=\"Fabric\"></a> <a href=\"make-bubbles-pop/files?gameVersionTypeId=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/supported/quilt_vector.svg\" alt=\"Quilt\"></a></p>\n<p>舊版 CurseForge 下載連結：</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/make-bubbles-pop/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7498\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/supported/forge_vector.svg\" alt=\"Forge\"></a> <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/make-bubbles-pop/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7499\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/supported/fabric_vector.svg\" alt=\"Fabric\"></a> <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/make-bubbles-pop/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:9153\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/supported/quilt_vector.svg\" alt=\"Quilt\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>NeoForge</strong> 目前尚未提供原生支援，但若與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sinytra-connector\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sinytra Connector</a> 同時安裝，仍可於 NeoForge 上執行 Make Bubbles Pop 的 Fabric 版本。</p>\n<p>下載最新版本，並將 <code>.jar</code> 檔案放入 Minecraft 目錄下的 <code>mods</code> 資料夾中。</p>\n<p>若要設定 Make Bubbles Pop，請搭配安裝 Fabric 版的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/midnightlib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MidnightLib</a> 或 Forge 版的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configured\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Configured</a>。</p>\n<p>目前不建議將 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/particle-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Particle Tweaks</a> 與 Make Bubbles Pop 同時安裝。</p>\n<h2>🗺️ 未來計畫功能</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原生 NeoForge 支援</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🔗 外部連結</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmake_bubbles_pop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://gistcdn.githack.com/Tschipcraft/452c07c3fc13361faa37e90d1262e4f7/raw/668cdb7776499728664beca45bd00227146f2b3f/modrinth-dark.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmod%252fmake-bubbles-pop-fabric%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/images/layout/favicon-32.png\" alt=\"PlanetMinecraft\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftschipcraft.ddns.net%252fen%252fmake_bubbles_pop.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://gistcdn.githack.com/Tschipcraft/7c6a2b28406185befdd8607b4a852f44/raw/005992426dd478c6cf941f8680046b7516fe6c9c/website_logo_curse.svg\" alt=\"Website\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fC0C5HEJB2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg\" alt=\"在 Ko-fi 上支持我\"></a></p>\n<h2>🤝 合作夥伴優惠</h2>\n<p>想要購買 <strong>Hytale</strong> 或升級版本嗎？在結帳時使用創作者代碼 <code>Tschipcraft</code>，即可讓我獲得佣金！（對您來說價格不會有任何改變）</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d2611\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://tschipo.alwaysdata.net/assets/partner/sparked_banner.png\" alt=\"透過 Sparked Host 架設伺服器支持我（此為聯盟行銷連結）\"></a></p>",
